Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.65,0:00:55.32,OPCNT - speak,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(150,150)\c&H000000DB\bord2\3c&H00FFFFFF}就算沒有希望也要突進
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.65,0:00:55.32,OPCNT - speak,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(150,150)\c&H000000DB\bord2\3c&H00FFFFFF}{\an2\fs40\pos(640,105)} 脈搏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.53,0:00:57.74,OPCNT - speak,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(150,150)\c&H000000DB\bord2\3c&H00FFFFFF}因為這就是我們的佐賀！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.53,0:00:57.74,OPCNT - speak,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(150,150)\c&H000000DB\bord2\3c&H00FFFFFF}{\an2\fs40\pos(805,105)} 傳奇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.45,0:01:02.95,OPCNT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}是誰在此憑弔  可我葬身遠方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.12,0:01:08.71,OPCNT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}悼詞劃破寂靜  道出我萌發的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.34,0:01:13.30,OPCNT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}許下誓言  道破天機
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.67,0:01:19.72,OPCNT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}屍骸層層堆積
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.93,0:01:23.35,OPCNT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}直到天際
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.64,0:01:29.19,OPCNT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}高聲唱吧  無果之花
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.19,0:01:32.07,OPCNT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}就算成泥也不止步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.07,0:01:35.24,OPCNT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}若有人愚弄我們無可退讓的尊嚴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.24,0:01:38.28,OPCNT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}就只管釋放內心的渴望
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.28,0:01:43.20,OPCNT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}就算腐朽也不止步 方為命脈
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.20,0:01:46.41,OPCNT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}向著天空吶喊  脫離生存的定義
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.41,0:01:50.13,OPCNT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)}寧可粉身碎骨  也要劃破黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.13,0:01:50.38,OPCNT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)\move(640,15,640,-50,)}寧可粉身碎骨  也要劃破黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.33,0:01:54.76,OPCNT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}通往加冕的勝機於雲間生光
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.76,0:01:58.18,OPCNT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}將決心烙印在宿命之上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.18,0:02:01.05,OPCNT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}在天地間狂亂綻放的佐賀
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
